message: "If you use this table or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "zh-glyph-similarity: A visual-similarity table for Chinese characters, Bopomofo, digits and Latin letters"
abstract: >-
  Pairwise visual similarity for 16,203 characters (Traditional and Simplified
  Chinese, Bopomofo, Arabic digits and Latin letters), computed with one
  stretch-tolerant chamfer metric on glyphs rendered with phone font stacks.
